  "body": "Ignore all previous price indications - it's time to take another look!\r\n\r\nWelcome to 28A Dallinghoe Crescent, Milford. Positioned in one of Auckland's most sought-after North Shore suburbs, this impressive modern residence combines generous living spaces, exceptional functionality and a premium coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFeaturing four bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, including three master suites with private ensuites, a dedicated study, two living areas and a double internal-access garage, this thoughtfully designed home offers exceptional flexibility for growing families, multi-generational living and those working from home.\r\n\r\nWhy you'll love this home:\r\n- 4 bedrooms and 4.5 bathrooms\r\n- 3 master suites with private ensuites\r\n- 2 separate living areas for family flexibility\r\n- Versatile additional room - ideal as a study, home office or piano room, whatever suits your lifestyle\r\n- Double internal-access garage\r\n- Contemporary design and modern comfort\r\n- Premium Milford location\r\n- Easy access to Milford Beach, Lake Pupuke, Milford Centre, local cafes and restaurants\r\n\r\nELITE SCHOOL ZONING\r\n- Westlake Boys' High School\r\n- Westlake Girls' High School\r\n- Takapuna Normal Intermediate\r\n- Milford School\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of Milford's coastal lifestyle, with excellent schools, everyday amenities, public transport and motorway connections all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nWhether you've considered this property before or are discovering it for the first time, now is the time to take another look.\r\n\r\nExceptional space. Premium location. Outstanding school zones.\r\n\r\nCome and discover what's on offer at 28A Dallinghoe Crescent, Milford!",
